      propertyPath: m_text
      value: '1. Attacking on the beat makes your attacks hit stronger, faster farther,
        and wider. Accurately timed attacks are tinted gold.

        2. Activating
        a movement ability on the beat reduces fuel consumption.

        3. Fuel
        recharges over time, health does not.

        4. Enemies move in steps to
        the beat. Some explode.'
