      propertyPath: m_text
      value: '1. Surviving a wave rewards you with the ability to swap your movement
        ability or your beat.

        2. Waves get progressively stronger.

        3.
        Enemies have a chance to drop upgrades to your attacks: Strength, Range,
        Spread, and Speed, as well as your characters: Max Health, Max Fuel, Fuel
        Recharge, and Speed.

        4. Enemies can drop consumables to instantly
        refill your health or your fuel.'
